    "title": "Plaquemine city hall transitioning to four-day workweek - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By WAFB Staff ,\n6 hours ago PLAQUEMINE, La. (WAFB) - The City of Plaquemine announced that city hall will be transitioning to a four-day workweek, effective February 18, 2026. The city light and water offices will remain open on Fridays to accept payments from 7:30 a.m. to 11:30 a.m. through March 12, 2026, to help customers transition to the new schedule. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
